WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.500
The morning sun rose over hills

00:01.500 --> 00:03.000
and the valley woke to birdsong

00:03.000 --> 00:04.500
Farmers walked the long fields early

00:04.500 --> 00:06.000
while children slept through the dawn

00:06.000 --> 00:07.500
Midday market filled with noisy crowds

00:07.500 --> 00:09.000
and traders shouted prices over stalls

00:09.000 --> 00:10.500
The afternoon breeze brought cool rest

00:10.500 --> 00:12.000
and quiet settled on the town
